     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; mso-no-proof: yes">中共绍兴市第一中学委员会 绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; mso-no-proof: yes">关于公布班子成员分工的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">各支部、处室、学科、年级：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">根据实施党组织领导下的校长负责制试点工作要求，结合</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“五星育人、三名争创”工作</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">和学校实际，经研究</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">决定对人事调整后的班子成员分工作如下调整和明确：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">王<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>琛（党委书记、校长），全面主持绍兴市第一中学党委和行政工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">孙洪亮（党委副书记、纪委书记），负责学校党建、党风廉政建设、行政人事、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">干部和队伍建设、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">文明（文化）校园建设、师德师风、学生德育、劳动教育、信访维稳、对外交流与宣传、贫困学生资助等工作，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">指导开展团、青、妇、民主党派工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">分管党政办、德育处、团委。联系各党支部、民主党派和高一年段。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">蒋<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>明（党委委员、副校长、工会主席），负责教学、教科研、信息化校园、体艺、考试、招生、教师专业发展与培训、校友会等工作。分管教学处、教科室。联系图书馆、实验室、各教研组、工会小组和高三年段。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">俞奇弘（党委委员、副校长），负责总务、后勤、卫生、财务、安全、招投标、基本建设等工作。分管总务处、安全处。联系财务室、医务室和高二年段。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">朱水军（党委委员、党政办主任）：主持党政办工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">王月琴（党委委员）：负责高三年段具体工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">班子成员实行“一岗双责”，落实全面从严治党主体责任，切实抓好分管、联系领域的各项工作，不断提升学校办学品质，保持学校的持续、高位、特色发展。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 64pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 4.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">中共绍兴市第一中学委员会<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">      </SPAN></SPAN>绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 208pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 13.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>19</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
